{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.823937+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_043a7b55dc29d8100596f91cf9f61913fa51c8ca5748ac61f7dd90b4cedf6ec1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 29 of arXiv:2609.03070, 'Variants of order semicontinuity in Banach lattices'] The following conditions are equivalent:
