{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.114319+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0e85b3fefd8ecaec8b576ff080b7cf78904dafab855ebdb10f501802dadea3cc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem LMA1 of arXiv:2608.16170, '\bf On hitting time distributions of Markov processes with sub-Gaussian heat kernel bounds'] For any $B\in \mathscr{B}(E)$,
