{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.423046+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_120f19aaef6fe957d27613c2d6b082f505dd609f6e04f716abb05e3b802bf50b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition analytic R transform of arXiv:2607.22156, 'A random matrix approach to lamplighter groups'] Let $x=u+u^*$.  For $\|b\|<1/2$,
