{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:44.553262+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17cd9fe4e28fbd33ef2f2774d09f6aa9e596214acf65903a07782cd3f43f579f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 9 (Solutions for $\theta\neq 0$) of arXiv:2604.02129, 'Realisation of constraints in underdamped Langevin dynamics'] Let $c^2 \neq 4ab$ with $\theta$ defined in~\eqref{def:theta}. Then~\eqref{eq:lemsollangevin} admits the solution 
