  \item [(ii)] Suppose that (H2) and (H4) hold. Assume that for some $\lambda\geq 0$,  $\mathbb{E}\int_{\mathbb{R}}|u^2(t,x) - u^1(t,x)|^2 e^{-\lambda|x|} dx <\infty$ for any $t\geq 0$. 
