{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.584246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a9722a32c08168ebaa31f6fa6744cfe0dfe3a8e16adef89ea8f3cb1bb6ca6cb","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] For $\Pi\in \mathcal P_{s,1}( \mathsf{S})$ and $m<n$    denote by $\Pi^{m,n}$ the pushforward of $\Pi$ under the map $
