{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.413763+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1bbc9d458bbdc1d79bfa3724ebee18fdcaddb1ca704d26cb1fb9014c331b3343","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:EL for k and tau of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] [ourpaper]

