{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.052690+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ef5911ac86d0db62122eed60c7c0e5913b902a14f87b53d68d5e2f727c4b50a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma sublemma of arXiv:2506.10448, 'Hitting probabilities and the Ekstr\"om--Persson conjecture'] For $\omega \in \Omega$ and $n\in \mathbb{N}$, define a measure $\mu_n^{\omega}$ by
