{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.543179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_206820dee89b8b14e8d1829792c8047ca3adc78abdf5f54ca3afbc4b1d158f34","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 19 of arXiv:2608.25971, 'Positive \texorpdfstring{$\tau$}{tau}-bi-Ricci curvature and Mean curvature flow with surg'] There are constants
