    but neither $G_1$ nor $G_2$ is of the form $(1+\mu(1-z))^{-1}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.668848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2337d7639628ea001ec1acf5cf6ebb52bb6fee954bb95bc3261f177d5a84504f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 3 (Classical identification with the Aldous process) of arXiv:2608.04799, '2608.04799'] The process constructed in Theorem~\ref{thm:main} satisfies
