{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.119772+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2355f10b4cd258bc1b9ebbf4c2c26b89eab174a3ce83582099c0de1131f586d6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:subcriticalproj of arXiv:2601.20502, 'Optimal matching under size priority'] Define the families of truncated decorated trees $\left(\mathbb{T}_H,o,i_{-}^{H},i_{+}^{H}\right)_{H \geq 0}$ as follows:
