{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:29.005977+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_25cd06250eac6319ce7301f64ab43da507445afad1b1406823d9beaac073f8ce","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm CT Hldr of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] There exists a deterministic function 
