{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.989400+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_27b7ca1e0d03d59ef49779fc20b3eb32665977afe72113b1f8dd3f3faa71c435","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] We have the following convergence as $m \to \infty$:

