{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.586390+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_27d093762187f8a681f6bc84d7a2cc8e43a115db0a46e1a505d60feeffc79ece","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm EVI_1_dim of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] Let $\mathsf{P},\mathsf{P}^* \in \mathcal P_{s,1}(\Gamma)$.  For $\mathsf{P}_t:= \mathsf{gap}^{-1}(\mathsf S^{gap}_t \mathsf{gap}(\mathsf{P}))$ the integral form EVI holds 
