  \end{equation}
When these conditions on $\rho$ are satisfied, we have:
   \begin{equation} 
      \limsup_{n\rightarrow\infty} V(\theta_n) = \limsup_{n\rightarrow\infty} \xi(\theta_n).
  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.052239+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a2963e49ed1bb87d51a9979c04c53f2e5a2e5619d835e976ff58ee8640d2301","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition defJVt of arXiv:2506.10448, 'Hitting probabilities and the Ekstr\"om--Persson conjecture'] Given an admissible sequence of open sets $\underline V$, define, for all $t\ge 0$, the hitting 
