{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.370804+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a6f5dafbb9e6c5f51a940166ff902848a0635edb76972cbc6c35a4b51a99fe9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2512.08595, 'Small time asymptotics of spectral heat content of isotropic processes'] For any bounded open set $\Omega$ with $C^{1,1}$ boundary we have
