{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.349150+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a9578f4e6a2300c5789521fec351da3132d21496614eaaa23729dd89ee1ff8e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] In the compact subset $B$ of the subcritical region, we have
