			\item  There is a coupling $\widehat{\BP}^{\SIR}$ of $\big(\xi_{t}^{(1)}\big) \sim\BP^{\SIR}_{\lambda,\mu,G,\Delta}$ and $\big(\xi_{t}^{(2)}\big)\sim
				\BP^{\SIR}_{\lambda, c\mu,G,\Delta}$ such that
				\begin{equation}
