{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.590154+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c051035a62f9cf14d89d6688d96108ed43a9d7062f12d68542c7d7bbb7e1fa2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm th:finite_time_identity_non_random_IC of arXiv:2412.03370, 'TASEP with a general initial condition and a deterministically moving wall'] For any $n \in \mathbb{N}$, it holds
