{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.414232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2cc6953b620203b49a327f08930be117c89b25fd6abe3dd33270ae9e94a9a3fb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma global lower bound for um of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] Let $(\lambda,C^2) \in S^0$. 
