\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.532546+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d06084707a57e73697f01999afc1f5dd85db23547937a2640e840825cb8d8e4","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 (Branching capacity from escape probabilities) of arXiv:2608.30668, 'Recurrence and capacity of stable branching random walks'] The branching capacity (associated with a \(\Tree\)-walk) of a finite
