{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.533519+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d5bcafa524a7f06418e4f319ae3dfb8364bd1d3b693c2dd37669fb0a92b9f64","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 of arXiv:2608.30668, 'Recurrence and capacity of stable branching random walks'] Consider a \(\Tree\)-walk in \(\Z^{d}\). We assume that there is
