[W]_{A_p}\approx_{p,d} \sup_{n\geq 1}\mathbb E_n\big(\|\widehat W_nW^{\frac{1}{p}}\|^{p}\big)\approx_{p,d}  \sup_{n\geq 1}\Big(\mathbb E_n\big(\|\widetilde W_nW^{-\frac{1}{p}}\|^{p'})\Big)^{\frac{p}{p'}}.
\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.789301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31685c00032b58bd50003f400a903cd88b1344bb0fcdabf5fb0fce288c65d787","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 21 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] Set, for $\theta>0$, $\alpha\in\N$ and $x\in\R$,

  $$ H_{\alpha}(x,\theta  ) =   e^{ \frac {\theta   } { 2 } |x |^2  } 
