{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:48:24.524014+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3198d71160238de640bd86a4faae655a2471b861cd6c3bc797ea9e6d30080ee6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem identity for coefficient of density in eigenbasis of arXiv:2512.20338, 'Up-down chains and scaling limits: \\ application to permuton- and graphon-valued diffusio'] The following identity holds:
    \begin{equation*}
		\sum_{ k = i }^{ j }
