{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.269111+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38e931919c45b0ff2370a27df1ec5c8f05a60871ee3ec62ba4a397d42f2a62db","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma estimates for discretized coefficients of arXiv:2411.05924, 'Non-negative Martingale Solutions to the Stochastic Porous Medium Equation with Sticky Beh'] For $n\in\mathbb N$, $\mathbf u_n\in \mathbb R^n$, $\theta\in[0,1]$, and $\mu \geq 1$ we have
