{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.559188+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_394312149585ebba7446a9bceb43dc6075249cd1969a7afe5039076d18b7de83","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2604.04882, 'On a Problem of M. Kac on Laplace Distributions'] We say that $\eta\in \cB\setminus\{0\}$ is \emph{indecomposable} if for every decomposition
