{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.012081+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e40246374c073a509f657e76c9d45352492abc5ffbb72c3029d18575f621883","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2605.04359, 'Well-posedness of reflected BSDEs with default time and irregular barrier: An application '] For each $n \geq 1$, and for any $t \in [0,T]$, we have
