{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.269539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3f950917441f7282c73fd31643edb0dcdcf60d747dc3819102151f5a9ef79a0d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma u Lu H-1 of arXiv:2411.05924, 'Non-negative Martingale Solutions to the Stochastic Porous Medium Equation with Sticky Beh'] For $\mathbf v_n, \mathbf w_n \in \mathbb R^n$,
