{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.736249+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40b25aa4646312f554ccc58132e74822a73c58d2c2d7b2cd8c6c354b3d2acd96","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 21 (Lemma 2.1, \cite{MR3406823}) of arXiv:2609.02197, '2609.02197'] \begin{enumerate}
