{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.687784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4112738574c471e94118e54487b4ac93fcd4bd632a66ea42162b718245fe0723","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop of arXiv:2510.18856, 'Evolution of recursive trees with limited memory'] Fix $\beta \in (0,1)$ and let $H_n(\beta)$ be the height of the tree $T_n$. Then
