For $\beta \le 0$, we have $\lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} \frac{1}{n} \log (Z_n^{\beta,231})=\lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} \frac{1}{n} \log (Z_n^{\beta,321})=\log 4$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

