{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.371646+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4179bfe20cdf27d53b46e6325a02e90a82b745068d9957d03ce0661e93044a0d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2512.08595, 'Small time asymptotics of spectral heat content of isotropic processes'] For any $\varepsilon>0$,
