{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.114004+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4277dc53fb9c67085b5c3fd2be2c3ee4199be31e79b6ec46d545641794cd1557","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem PROB1 of arXiv:2608.16170, '\bf On hitting time distributions of Markov processes with sub-Gaussian heat kernel bounds'] $p^+_\sigma\in \mathrm{p} \mathscr{B}((0,\infty))\times \mathscr{B}^*(E)\times \mathscr{B}(E)$ satisfies
