{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:15.264379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_449ca6f42a53ead6d6536751256d4acf598b592ab8e014f8bc2f5293abb49c79","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[2 5 of arXiv:2607.12303, 'Marginal Stationary Distributions and Convergence Rates of Higher Order Markov Chains'] {\rm \cite{HanXu26}}

