{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:28.068235+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4afa9434eab5275504c03ab80892159a4bf56b4bf7693b633ee7eda5736427b4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2607.13401, 'Total variation cutoff for Kac's walk on the sphere'] For every \(\varepsilon>0\), there are constants
