{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:38:25.225383+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d801db0a13da2e4f4d3dbb089977d61d19e60595a577fe38bce98e4920a2caa","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition ineq:trace_mdm of arXiv:2609.00324, 'Quantitative Stability for Fractional Yamabe minimizers'] For any $\varepsilon>0$ there exists $C_\varepsilon >0$ such that
