{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:41:11.645574+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4dbdccc9c0e22a29107e9fb7f09ebb787f0d645a78cf8b50c9f6d77d8536d6ea","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop mixing2 of arXiv:2411.13926, 'Random walks on random walks:\\ non-perturbative results in high dimensions'] Consider the RWRW model on $\ensuremath{\mathbb{Z}}^d$ with $d\geq 1$ and  $\lambda >0$.
