    \int_{\ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^m} |x|^2 \mu_0(dx) < \infty.
\end{equation}
Then, the trajectory $\{\mu_t\}_{t \in [0, T]}$ is a weak solution to (equation eq:ap1:formalPDE of the paper) in the sense of Definition (def:ap1:wp of the paper) if and only if there is a weak solution $\tilde{\mu} \in \mathcal{P}(C[0, T]; \ensuremath{\mathbb{R}}^m))$ to the following SDE
