{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.299427+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5260eb11222af38e820cc648a8553193b4020c609f20eedf6b292602461956d3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi def:regular of arXiv:2608.30382, 'Convergence rates for the RMSprop optimizer with full control of the hyperparameters'] Let $c,q\in(0,\infty)$.
