{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.841688+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_541dc45f6a43c0811e3a9b4270fa8c9b1dca3a86bf9e0f1920dcab8470375079","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 of arXiv:2608.13631, 'The classical discrete laws near the mode:\\ complete local expansions for the negative bi'] Under the hypotheses of Theorem~\ref{thm:nb-main},
