{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:24.615046+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5800a69e007ebe5306614dd2df84af04e86276feafdb133822f03927a8eeb557","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 15 (Transition times) of arXiv:2506.09462, 'Transition Path Theory For L\'{e}vy-Type Processes: SDE Representation and Statistics'] The sets $\mathcal{R}_{A \to B}$ and $\mathcal{R}_{B \to A}$ of transition times are given by
