{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:28:08.697071+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_59748170b40af8565f9fbb3b89680eb70efa0247f776d1b61631ee7b4dbc8e0b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Utility representation) of arXiv:2607.29560, 'Tractable Relaxations of Multivariate Stochastic Dominance via Optimal Transport and CVaR'] For every $\gamma\in[0,1]$,
