\end{equation}
for any fixed $\xi>0$, uniformly in $t\in [0,T]$ and $z=z_T\in\mathcal{D}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:22:01.679027+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a286222ac1facea4ca4077c8c6cacd827ce2ea4675d9ff9e6a1a26a3e114507","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Question of arXiv:2605.02226, 'Finitely Dependent Processes on Subshifts'] \begin{enumerate}
