{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.702509+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c375911a071bac1c84fb83b27e17dadd461cb780872f9f646b2c610322e0f03","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2608.06038, 'Efron type identities\\ for stopping sets and Poisson hulls'] Let $\eta$ be as in Theorem~\ref{t:spatMarkov}. Let $(Z_n)$ be a 
