{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:11:11.706025+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e1f5b8dafe9f9809009189290b2c1478f6640aafe6b71a4ef5c3f397a96d0b0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop cert of arXiv:2609.00672, 'Deciding superellipticity and computing the Weierstrass normal form'] Under (eq:fibres of the paper), the following are equivalent.
\begin{enumerate}[(i)]
