\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.161751+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e8179c046460b7dd87ba35c13007990174dac89445a92cb886bdc26bce7871a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2604.17302, 'Elephant random walk with attributed steps and extractions of random sizes'] Suppose we are in Scenario~\eqref{Scenario_1}, and let $H_{0}$, defined in \eqref{H_{0}_defn}, satisfy the criterion:
