{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.990529+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_611f315e2616009217dc4bb5bd6915255fff4a4aa728697251720e4b76b186da","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] The probabilities ${\tilde p}_n^\nu(t)$
