{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.154500+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6339c4904b5aee94792b080a292e616ddaa7a5ad2d75f007ebe91cc8a81b0623","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Passing-row slack) of arXiv:2609.01570, 'A Proof of Fraenkel's Conjecture'] Let \(n=|A|-1\).  If the \(s\)-row has mass at least one, then
