{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.943269+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_696d84e0019ef089652c1bdfd7758e1daebdc4f8ffe1e2578a4e617837fe07ca","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 49 (Full Newton congruence filtration) of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] For every zero-framed knot $K$, every $n\ge2$, and $r>s\ge0$,
