{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.788606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6a4bc11b65c33c55678c419c40b1d36bc0d4ef5f53a264ab1efe7bf657f0aa66","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem of arXiv:2606.09228, 'On topological indices of random caterpillar graphs'] We have 
    \begin{align*}
    \begin{split}
    \Var\left(\sum_{i<j} (j-i+2)I_iI_j\right)=&\frac{n^3(m-1)(m-2)(m+1)(m+2)}{180m^2}
        \\
        &+\frac{n^2(m-1)(m^3+m^2+71m+251)}{90m^2}
