{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.260577+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6b6273c898b2397b3078fa40dca7957d6b39368805e15c867f0aa64d8045ee9d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 (\cite{paper1}) of arXiv:2609.01114, 'Unbalanced spectral Tur\'an problem for color-critical graphs with prescribed large maximu'] For a graph $F$ with $\chi(F)=r+1\geq 3$, define
