    \end{equation}
    where the limit is in $L^2(\mathbb P)$,  $(\xi_k)_{k\geq1}$ are the i.i.d. labels of the loops, and $(\phi^\mathds A_k)_{k\geq1}$ are independent GFFs inside each loop.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.371723+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_6f9b09c049e34225388935b574fbff914183df59449d885a69dd3d4232a7e04d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 of arXiv:2512.08595, 'Small time asymptotics of spectral heat content of isotropic processes'] For any $\eta\in (0,1)$ and $\epsilon>0$,
