{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.685570+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_701437465af37983671f34069e621e87120e034ec726a555bff2d48ce34e4047","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem malthus of arXiv:2510.18856, 'Evolution of recursive trees with limited memory'] Consider the branching process $\BP_\theta$. Then 
