{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.362907+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70414ab5654995150a7ac24d49f59b0ee26de1f5bc680f669b94032f61586215","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 5 of arXiv:2606.18047, 'Analysis of the asymmetric shelf shuffle'] For fixed $i\geq 1$, we have 
