{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.348720+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_70f1f028852d5f7bfe01ba00bb256c35e077ce57301703bcd5af60534b6881ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] In the subset $B$ of the subcritical region considered in \cref{thm:twostar}, we have
