{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:04.214736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_743b40c229de3fb7b94052c6a6c094650cf9bfa4e02fc1b75b094594beeec898","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 20 of arXiv:2608.03956, 'From Triangular Array Progression\\ to Near-Log-Concave State Transitions'] Let $\mathcal{S}^{(y,n)}$ be as in (\ref{shannonsum}). Then,
