{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:51:26.607377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_75a39d626c17335cb28f8b8c02415d7da9f4ead5c31b70ef420921de7757d019","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Eq:weakconvergence of arXiv:2606.03079, 'Mean Field Limits for Stochastic, Underdamped Reactive Langevin Dynamics Models'] (Weak Convergence). For any $\Phi \in \mathcal{S}$ and $0 \leq r_{1} \leq r_{2} \cdots \leq r_{W}=s<t<T$ and $\{\psi_{w}\}_{w=1}^{W} \subset$ $B\left(\otimes_{j=1}^{J} M_{F}(\mathbb{R}^{d}\times \mathbb{R}^{d})\right)$, we have that
