{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.464491+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7883779799d7c289f9800d6dfccc97ba0b0720b28bc86489c3628a6d037ff774","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 16 (Approximation) of arXiv:2608.17540, 'Pathwise stability for one-dimensional SDEs driven by Brownian motion and a symmetric stab'] For all $x\in\R$, $\delta\ge2$, and $\eps\in(0,1)$,
