{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.535281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7980670c1ad3ee75b7c007d25bd35a8a7ca485884c696db3e92c91f21820b0c1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2603.28170, 'Stabilization time of finite configurations with a second class particle in discrete TASEP'] Let $p\in(0,1)$ be fixed and let $\omega\in\Omega_n$ be sampled according to the Bernoulli initial condition of parameter $p$
