{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.584629+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_79f535b15a773f2ae1c1c78ec0b62c3cca15c8cfb7e50d1e0cce8383102652c3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi eq:w gap of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] For $p\geq 1$  and  $\Pi_i\in \mathcal P_{s,1}( \mathsf{S})$, $i=0,1$, 
