{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:14:37.643745+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7b798dfa2d98b121244fa8bc7439de1f6eed54e7f6d73a47259881723930a199","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 10 of arXiv:2608.19179, 'A random walk on $p$-groups with a symmetric perfect pairing'] We define 
