{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:29:08.635448+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7d299f72d6fe94db4e98a62b991aeb2889fdc51c678a3ba077fbe21c3c1c9917","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary a7 of arXiv:2411.19926, 'Sparse Pseudospectral Shattering'] Suppose $M\in{\mathbb{C}}^{n\times n}$ satisfies $\left\|M\right\|\le1$. Let
