{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.169165+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_7df82f7d163da860130ee67a2c5baf1624ef322ebf97652026dc05d7627a9673","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2604.18871, 'Quantitative approximation of the Vlasov(--Fokker--Planck)--Navier--Stokes system by stoch'] With the same assumptions and notations as in Theorem~\ref{th:convBessel},
