{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:30.013320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8d2af40891e4ceffc86f7794b4892b6a424a420b9cd0c51be855ff6f4f734879","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 24 (Comparison theorems) of arXiv:2605.04359, 'Well-posedness of reflected BSDEs with default time and irregular barrier: An application '] Assume that:
	\begin{itemize}
		\item $\xi^1 \leq \xi^2$.
		\item $
		f^1\left(t, Y_t^2, Z_t^2,U^2_t\right) \leq f^2\left(t, Y_t^2, Z_t^2,U^2_t\right),~t \in [0,T],~d\mathbb{P}\otimes dt\text{-a.e.}
		$
