{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:28.068521+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e7c34ebb125a9db3a46a1e8cfdeab72de135da7261b7756478b193f68a117a4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.13401, 'Total variation cutoff for Kac's walk on the sphere'] Let \(A\) be a random vector in \((0,\infty)^n\), let
