{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:42:57.241250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8e879d85d2b1ea0772b1b9289bfe6d3b2648db42e5eb4cec1c39b25b64dc7f0c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:task-symmetry of arXiv:2608.20295, 'Physical-Support Confidence Sets for Highly Coherent Dictionaries'] For every fixed $2\le r\le q-1$ and every interior coefficient vector $x$,
