{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.095024+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_8f26062a4d3ed5b68c40d3e6283aa01506ac772e94105d081b55880c87c44e1b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem2 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Let $p\ge 2$ and $s\ge 1$ be such that $s\le \frac{np}{(n-2)_+}$.

