\end{equation*}
where $M=\max_{i}\left\|X_i\right\|_{\psi_2}$ and $c>0$ is a universal constant. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:49.276859+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_904e2f73dec9e8fcb9ca0dd7d1fb72944f2957a5eb685c92b8c61c10f250952e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Positive zero of the signed generator) of arXiv:2606.22066, 'A Bessel-zero obstruction to hyperbolic complete monotonicity of noncentral chi-square den'] Let \(a,b,\theta>0\).  Then the entire function
