{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.686425+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_915d9c8a74c1cd46feda4b0dc8516eeb5f90e8afe748c35a80be1f5105a09049","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem bigggg-lemma of arXiv:2510.18856, 'Evolution of recursive trees with limited memory'] \textcolor{black}{Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a bounded subset in $R_{+}^{K^2+K}$. Then we have 
