	\end{equation*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:20:15.585093+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_92ac688c9ce53400a9d3381ffea236a5beb8fbad3f0aa7b990326aba9afe8cd2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:local-arithmetic of arXiv:2609.00777, 'Universal murmuration and Hecke augmentation'] Let $D,M\geq1$ and $1\leq r<2\sqrt Q/\sqrt{X+Y}$ with $P\nmid r$.
