{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.844362+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9aa7c369dd0f8a0fe82a20bb732fc54b8bdc874c61c6d1410819ea66a8d9d061","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:moments of arXiv:2608.23742, 'Second-order fusion asymptotics for $\Sine_\beta$ correlation functions'] Let $m\ge2$, $\beta>0$, $m\beta>1$, and put $\delta=m\beta/2$. Then
