  \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.780765+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c01898fcf5793b20dcafa5f13a8af3ef58b36caabcb7c4f04bdcb2349017b23","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2603.25615, 'Fourier dimension of Mandelbrot cascades on planar curves'] Let $\beta<\widetilde{\tau}(2)$. Then, almost surely, 
