{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:53.446935+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9c8b2c8f6b58fba5b9851f25c8323e9febacb35a2428a608cf818b4643fe7432","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2606.15843, 'Long-time behaviour of DLRA for SDEs'] Suppose Assumptions~(H1)--(H6) hold. Moreover,
