{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:11:09.320042+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_9d50ca428b99df69029f24c00ec79c63b9a80572a156c8f5fec86175a32fa35d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma le:laplace-IG of arXiv:2411.06195, 'Restrictions of some reinforced processes to subgraphs'] If $X\sim \operatorname{IG}(\frac{a}{2},\frac{a^2}{2})$ for some $a>0$, then
