{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:29.008566+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a03f67c95851d273be3eb3872e9c7a42c3019cf45a95d0ab87e49feca90d5138","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem exs thP of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] There exists a constant $a_4 \in (0,1)$ such that, 
