{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.651290+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a72a163a958d380b648741ecd3dce18bb75a32c3cd2f0da7e663e791af4e5943","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop onsager of arXiv:2602.06011, 'Excursion decomposition of the XOR-Ising model'] Let $D$ be a bounded, simply connected domain. For any continuous, bounded  function $f:\mathbb C\to\mathbb R$,
