{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:02:08.121784+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_a78c1f8776b0fa81af06d0210b3cffb7ea453f5246f733728a153b38757874ba","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2608.27433, 'Scalar curvature on K\"ahler blow-ups and systolic inequalities'] There is a constant $C$, independent of $\eps$, such that
