{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.232836+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ae47101f92fd527a88f1a83314da80e46a31ca8ee346fc567dcec62e54479cac","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorema 2 ({\Cref{criterion-decomp-log}}) of arXiv:2609.00567, 'Hodge--Tate splitting and Akizuki--Nakano vanishing in positive characteristic'] Let \(X\) be a smooth \(k\)-variety of dimension \(d\), and let \(D\)
