}
  .
} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.584102+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b2ca0037bba557fac1bcce0a5401371eb25d2b30ccce023229117418d8620bcf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Georgii of arXiv:2509.08659, 'Gap metrics for stationary point processes and quantitative convexity of the free energy'] Let $\mathsf{P}\in \mathcal P_{s,1}(\Gamma)$. Then
