{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.328378+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b44e6d63b5a8c931d6e98316843df2fd5a6c8f418da1200ab6ea1e0aca970ea7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:BBMD of arXiv:2609.04045, 'Heat content and spectrum for subordinated sub-Laplacians'] Let $\Omega\subset \mathbb{G}$ be a bounded domain with smooth boundary with no characteristic points. Then, 
