{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.717568+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_b98fa54302f4beeb7c56c574b64c26582b25cfc8e749c41ecb0165d3182d21a7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 (Bridge marginal and dual-potential factorization) of arXiv:2609.02196, 'Schr\"odinger Bridges on Lie Group Manifolds for Probabilistic Intrinsic Generation'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:endpoint-kernel} we have 
