{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.115773+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_bd9c3845147ae33ef5d29b6a3414da8aa73ab1605fb81a6148b2f6e62a5abe54","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary COR63 of arXiv:2608.16170, '\bf On hitting time distributions of Markov processes with sub-Gaussian heat kernel bounds'] Assume that the assumptions of Theorems~(THM61-2 of the paper) and (THM61 of the paper) are both satisfied. If the transition density function of $X$ satisfies
