{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:48:47.285105+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c432443924aabdfa022b863f041bdbf19992948d4edc4e73215123fed127be26","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm smc_density of arXiv:2604.20629, 'Rates of forgetting for the sequentially Markov coalescent'] The SMC process conditioned on $Y_{0}=x>0$
