{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.039802+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_c975d1ee0d34b5bf322fbdfe539cc819234189b07f334e4a1a9909a2fdb7900f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2606.26619, 'Ergodicity of stochastic reaction-diffusion equations on unbounded domains driven by space'] Let $u$ be the solution to the following equation driven by space-time white noise $W$:
