Here, the constants are as in Hypotheses~(hyp:coerc of the paper),~(hyp:monotonicity of the paper),~(hyp:growth of the paper),~and~(hyp:quant of the paper), respectively.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:37:15.264642+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d2e081d24f65fbe771349d7c20533fe239c4f018e02e3794a53981f8dc974e56","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[10 7 of arXiv:2607.12303, 'Marginal Stationary Distributions and Convergence Rates of Higher Order Markov Chains'] {\rm 
