{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:13:49.969361+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d41c93fee1d806d87158d2c20ef4f5d732de2d6035f197c681b508f6dd42ba82","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:dense_discrete_measures of arXiv:2411.07113, '\begin{LARGE}On differentiability and mass distributions of topologically typical multivar'] The following assertions hold:
