{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:51:11.953201+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_d98b34f1aec32f1b4c80bf65f34b4e19ab921b87b8a31ba4ae979bb92a6443df","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Bulk contour statistic) of arXiv:2608.07820, 'Linear Spectral Statistics for Entrywise-Transformed Spiked Wigner Matrices under Shifted '] Let \(A\) be a real symmetric matrix and let \(\varphi\) be analytic on a
