{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:00.755220+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e12bf2f12e47d13b25efeacad81776bf9c0a870dda03a691163b8d1b37bd7ac1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2512.02922, 'Asymptotics for additive functionals of particle systems via Stein's method'] We have  that  \begin{align}
