{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:20:07.934244+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_e82d8f20695647ec3c4ec7d4192f49521a580165f92aa8365183069e6e7c83b1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:lower22 of arXiv:2608.30254, 'Exact Recovery Thresholds for Weighted Data Selection\\ in Vector-Valued Linear Regression'] There is an explicit dataset $D^\triangle$ with
