{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:27:56.773450+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ebe6c83dd810414b788ef2003a902675ff0412ce58abd37231a01afe791bf248","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 3 of arXiv:2608.31171, '\bf Finite-energy spacetimes with torus symmetry. \\ \Large Cauchy stability of Einstein--'] With the operators defined above, the \textbf{\JKL{} formulation of Einstein--Euler areal flows} is the system
\bel{equa-9385}
\begin{alignedat}{2}
