{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:48:25.146205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ee812194f24d203b5324d24f2f186f3df2868f21ce2903357c60319c126eabb1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem construction-of-mn of arXiv:2607.05097, 'Asymptotics of Lyapunov Exponents and Phase Transitions for Fluids with Degenerate Forcing'] There exist open sets $\mathcal{M}_N \subset \mathbb{R}^d \times S^{n-1}$ for $N \in \mathbb{N}$ satisfying
