{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.788104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eeaaf413fb298e3ed826ddad61121f27ac86909fb6b0cbaa21afd8336910f983","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theo 9 of arXiv:2609.02261, 'Quantization and process'] Take  $F$ and $G$ belonging to 
