{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.935823+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eeac64bd7d1058b6dada5e9249e2fd7979811cccd1ce363380b8f20c8b339a4f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:right-linf of arXiv:2602.07920, 'On the position matrix of single-shelf shuffle and card guessing'] Let $n\ge 2$ and let $i\in E_n$ be even with $0\le i\le n-1$. Then for all
