{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:57:59.840287+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_eec86513853ba9f57f98005784be21efc1e0ad850c7e76810dba24f682b22f6f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm_reachability of arXiv:2606.09488, 'The temporal stochastic block model'] Under assumptions $(ass1 of the paper)$ and (ass2 of the paper), for any $v\in V$,
