{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.349449+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_ef0e5843c2b95ce1373a895f3bd5588c76f7b4507bbd64415efcc541c165ada5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2506.15159, 'Conditional central limit theorems for exponential random graphs'] From \cref{eq:PoincareERGM}, we have, for any function $g: \mathcal{I}\to \IR$,
