{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.029951+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_f79907dca11223b60880ac28a2eccc0627c3747e1dd519cff44e36ec86a5e14f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[The 23 of arXiv:2609.02879, 'On the cut locus of Hamilton--Jacobi equations I: structure and propagation via the touchi'] Let $\phi\in\text{\rm SCL}\,(\T^n)$. Then we have
